msgid "Choosing an Antenna"
msgstr "选择天线"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:7 d4ffc885fe4a47759efa7cc4a6cf1700
msgid "Your choice of directional antenna will most likely be based upon:"
msgstr "选择定向天线时通常需要考虑下列因素："

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:9 0b311d71c2254480bd46e4961a505b5d
msgid "Size and weight limitations"
msgstr "尺寸与重量限制"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:10 04c43bfcf15e43efa7700ffe38904bbc
msgid "Desired transmission distance"
msgstr "所需传输距离"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:11 1d9f904e76c9432b8c94bd2da11067a4
msgid ""
"Radio frequency (the antenna should be designed for the radio's frequency)"
msgstr "无线电频率（天线应针对电台所用频率设计）"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:12 ad8e25674f3d4ac8a8f2c9e3e598b8f0
