#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:20 25696729ac9141d687a7710808642166
msgid "Antenna dBi and transmission distance"
msgstr "天线 dBi 与传输距离"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:22 c6a6d9552e2646db8eb41b3268c97bd0
msgid ""
"Antennas with higher dBi values will be able to transmit further. A general "
"rule of thumb (gathered from `fpvlab.com "
"<http://fpvlab.com/forums/showthread.php?4683-Formula-to-calculate-distance-"
"from-antennas-gains&p=78052&viewfull=1#post78052>`__ and `zytrax.com "
"<http://www.zytrax.com/tech/wireless/calc.htm>`__) is:"
msgstr ""
"更高 dBi 值的天线可以传输更远。一条粗略经验法则（综合自 `fpvlab.com "
"<http://fpvlab.com/forums/showthread.php?4683-Formula-to-calculate-distance-"
"from-antennas-gains&p=78052&viewfull=1#post78052>`__ 与 `zytrax.com "
"<http://www.zytrax.com/tech/wireless/calc.htm>`__）："

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:27 d72611b2815c482caf32e46da79a3227
msgid ""
"Increasing the antenna gain by 6dBi (i.e. from 2dBi to 8dBi) will double the"
" range"
msgstr "天线增益每提高 6dBi（例如从 2dBi 提高到 8dBi），有效传输距离翻倍"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:28 1ba9f40dc134423cb9cccc1b5ddb09be
msgid ""
"Increasing the transmitter power by 4x (i.e. from 20mW to 80mW) will double "
"the range"
msgstr "发射功率每提高 4 倍（例如从 20mW 提高到 80mW），有效传输距离翻倍"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-antenna.rst:30 6b874ed3d2944e318c54a90bc3d1df4b
msgid ""
"The standard :ref:`3DR radio <copter:common-sik-telemetry-radio>` comes with"
" a 2dBi antenna."
msgstr "标准 :ref:`3DR 电台 <copter:common-sik-telemetry-radio>` 配备的是 2dBi 天线。"

